      "_id": "25f3cb0bb2cfcf2b",
      "name": "Invisibility",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/explosion.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>INVISIBILITY 1 (General Utility)<br>As an Action, turn invisible until the end of your next Turn. While invisible, you gain Hidden: attacks against you have Disadvantage and your attacks have Advantage. Hidden ends if you attack, use a visible power, or take damage. Sound and scent can still reveal you.<br>Enhancement: Sound is muffled and distorted while active.<br>Enhancement: Sustainable Power - may be maintained with a Bonus Action each turn.</p>",
