    {
      "_id": "268bb93e14392cff",
      "name": "Spirit Speech",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/explosion.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>SPIRIT SPEECH 1 (General Utility)<br>You can perceive and briefly communicate with spirits of the recently dead if they died within the last week and their remains, a significant possession, or death location is within Short range. Willing spirits communicate for up to one minute. With one minute at a corpse or death location, experience the subject’s final moments. Advantage on Occult checks related to death and spiritual activity.<br>Enhancements: Automatically senses spirits nearby; extended duration for willing spirits to one scene; can communicate with spirits that refused to cross over after one week and remain in Limbo/Purgatory.</p>",
        "subtype": "Power Set",
        "action": "Passive",
        "category": "Power Set",
